{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Since we last spoke, some big things have happened. Last week I went to an LGBTQ+ pride parade. Everyone was so happy and it made me feel like I belonged. It showed me how much our community has grown, it was amazing!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-12ddd8967af6ca4f24293759", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.516434+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "12ddd8967af6ca4f24293759", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "12ddd8967af6ca4f24293759", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, Caroline, sounds like the parade was an awesome experience! It's great to see the love and support for the LGBTQ+ community. Congrats! Has this experience influenced your goals at all?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-be6f1051037dd13c439afd85", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.547391+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "be6f1051037dd13c439afd85", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "be6f1051037dd13c439afd85", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Mel! It really motivated me for sure. Talking to the community made me want to use my story to help others too - I'm still thinking that counseling and mental health is the way to go. I'm super excited to give back."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-c66642940d692691b7c02bdc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.567444+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c66642940d692691b7c02bdc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c66642940d692691b7c02bdc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, Caroline! That's great! I just signed up for a pottery class yesterday. It's like therapy for me, letting me express myself and get creative. Have you found any activities that make you feel the same way?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-3f08ee1f201f2d24dbfbcc09", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.596924+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3f08ee1f201f2d24dbfbcc09", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3f08ee1f201f2d24dbfbcc09", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Wow, Melanie! I'm getting creative too, just learning the piano. What made you try pottery?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-81696dbd7f7828e1a13764d1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.620576+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "81696dbd7f7828e1a13764d1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "81696dbd7f7828e1a13764d1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: I'm a big fan of pottery - the creativity and skill is awesome. Plus, making it is so calming. Look at this!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-5e05d2e9681a141267045108", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.639902+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5e05d2e9681a141267045108", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5e05d2e9681a141267045108", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: That bowl is gorgeous! The black and white design looks so fancy. Did you make it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-629b51f139e70686a2188733", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.660467+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "629b51f139e70686a2188733", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "629b51f139e70686a2188733", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Thanks, Caroline! Yeah, I made this bowl in my class. It took some work, but I'm pretty proud of it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-cac490c449902a3c34b3c67d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.679148+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cac490c449902a3c34b3c67d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cac490c449902a3c34b3c67d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Nice job! You really put in the work and it definitely shows. Your creativity looks great!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-424a3018206d5deacb39dc59", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.699416+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "424a3018206d5deacb39dc59", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "424a3018206d5deacb39dc59", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Thanks, Caroline! Your kind words mean a lot. Pottery is a huge part of my life, not just a hobby - it helps me express my emotions. Clay is incredible, it brings me so much joy!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-820be426d855577cff6c43af", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.719346+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "820be426d855577cff6c43af", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "820be426d855577cff6c43af", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Wow, Mel, I'm so stoked for you that art is helping you express yourself and bring you joy! Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-02e20174e616f67323f0e0e4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.740965+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "02e20174e616f67323f0e0e4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "02e20174e616f67323f0e0e4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Thanks, Caroline! I'm excited to see where pottery takes me. Anything coming up you're looking forward to?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-366655dbaaa6f8abd6595538", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.756943+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "366655dbaaa6f8abd6595538", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "366655dbaaa6f8abd6595538", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks Mel! I'm going to a transgender conference this month. I'm so excited to meet other people in the community and learn more about advocacy. It's gonna be great!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-288b5ebbca43411e0835b60d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.777426+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "288b5ebbca43411e0835b60d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "288b5ebbca43411e0835b60d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Sounds awesome, Caroline! Have a great time and learn a lot. Have fun!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-9436681389599e16366f9178", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.797336+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9436681389599e16366f9178", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9436681389599e16366f9178", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Cool, thanks Mel! Can't wait. I'll keep ya posted. Bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-c93e49a64466b809f3b8357e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.816350+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c93e49a64466b809f3b8357e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c93e49a64466b809f3b8357e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Bye, Caroline! Can't wait to hear about it. Have fun and stay safe!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_5-dcd3242c39663fb433c1dda8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:01:29.831382+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dcd3242c39663fb433c1dda8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dcd3242c39663fb433c1dda8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
